,{"type":"text","text":"registration an administrator made from one that arrived over an open endpoint. Three things"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"read it and each would otherwise have to infer provenance from something that is not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provenance: * "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"axiam_oauth2::fapi"},{"type":"text","text":" refuses a FAPI profile on anything but"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"Self::Admin","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" (I5) — a client nobody vetted cannot be financial-grade; * the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"authorization endpoint forces a consent hop for every other value (D4) — an unrelated party"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"gets a question put to the end user, whatever scopes it asked for; * the T21.4 sweeper"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deletes only "},{"identifier":"Self::Dcr","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" rows, so an administrator’s client is never swept however"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"long it sits unused. "},{"identifier":"Self::Admin","overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"code":"Admin","type":"codeVoice"}],"overridingTitle":"Admin","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is the serde default and therefore what every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"row written before T21.4 decodes to, which is the truth: they were all created through "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/oauth2-clients"},{"type":"text","text":" by somebody holding "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"oauth2_clients:create"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ManagedBy","type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"Self::Dcr":{"type":"link","identifier":"Self::Dcr","titleInlineContent":[{"code":"Dcr","type":"codeVoice"}],"url":"Self::Dcr","title":"Dcr"},"doc://AxiamSDK/docume